Type: Package
Package: bmiqpp
Title: BMIQ Calibration with Rcpp
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Hung", "Pham", , "amser.hoanghung@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-8271-9355"))
Description: Internal package implementing the Horvath and Teschendorff
    BMIQ (beta-mixture quantile normalization) calibration in Rcpp. The
    core parameter estimation uses a Newton-Raphson algorithm with step
    halving for robust convergence when calibrating DNA methylation beta
    values.
